# wide_roster -- a declaration that reads whole and still outruns the roster.
#
# Five domains around one hub, every domain wired and every region held, so
# `system.verify` answers `whole`. The capability table holds four dependents,
# so `roster.from_system` refuses this document by name rather than seating
# four of the five and calling the supervisor ready.
#
# The bound that refuses here belongs to the SUPERVISOR, not to the
# declaration -- which is exactly the distinction this artifact exists to
# make visible.
#
# Read by `caravan/roster.rye`; proven by tools/ca/caravan_roster_witness.rish.

system wide_roster

domain hub
domain client_a
domain client_b
domain client_c
domain client_d

channel hub client_a
channel hub client_b
channel hub client_c
channel hub client_d

region shared 4096

grant shared hub rw
grant shared client_a r
grant shared client_b r
grant shared client_c r
grant shared client_d r
